   "label": "f02-authn-vs-authz",
   "front": "Authentication versus authorization in IDURAR: what is enforced, and what is missing?",
   "back": "Authentication: every /api route except login/reset passes isValidAuthToken (JWT signature plus loggedSessions membership). Authorization: none; queries never filter by createdBy and there is one owner role. Fine single-tenant, an IDOR once a second user exists; fix it in shared middleware.",
   "observation": "read-derived",
